  "description": "Welcome to your perfect Costa del Sol getaway. This beautifully designed, newly built ground-floor apartment offers the ideal mix of modern comfort, outdoor living, and resort-style amenities—perfect for families, couples, or groups looking to relax in style.\n\nThe property features three spacious bedrooms, two full bathrooms, and an additional guest toilet, comfortably accommodating up to six guests. The interior is bright and contemporary, with high-quality finishes and a clean, modern design throughout, creating a calm and stylish atmosphere.\n\nStep outside into your private garden, a true highlight of the home, where you can enjoy sunny afternoons, dine al fresco, or make the most of warm evenings with your own BBQ area.\n\nSet within a secure gated community, the apartment gives you access to excellent shared facilities. You can unwind in one of the three swimming pools, including a dedicated children’s pool and a beautiful pool with sea views, or enjoy year-round relaxation in the indoor heated pool. For those who like to stay active, there is also a fully equipped gym and two padel courts available to residents.\n\nThe property also includes a private underground parking space for added convenience. Ideally located in the sought-after Bel-Air area near Cancelada, the apartment sits perfectly between Marbella and Estepona, making it easy to explore beaches, restaurants, golf courses, and everything the Costa del Sol has to offer while still enjoying a peaceful setting.\n\nPlease note, we welcome families and couples only. We do not accept groups under 30, nor hen or stag parties. If you fall outside this category but would like to book, please send us an inquiry with more details about your group, and we can consider your request.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you!",
